  "content": {
    "title": "Rita's Italian Ice to give away free Italian ice today nationwide",
    "text": "Rita's Italian Ice8 & Frozen Custard will give away free Italian ice on March 20.Courtesy of Rita's Italian Ice & Frozen CustardRita's Italian Ice & Frozen Custard is giving away free Italian ice on Friday in honor of the first day of spring.The Italian ice eatery is giving away free six-ounce Italian ices to customers at its locations nationwide, according to a news release from Rita's Italian Ice. Article continues below this adGet Digital Access and Stay Informed With Trusted Local News.Get Digital Access and Stay Informed With Trusted Local News.ONLY 25¢There are five Rita's Italian Ice locations in Connecticut, according to its website, in New London, Middlebury, Farmington, West Hartford and Vernon.In addition to free Italian ice, customers also can try Rita's Italian Ice's new \"mystery\" Peeps-flavored Italian ice Friday. The Peeps Italian ice will be available only for a limited time.The Italian ice will be served as a white Italian ice \"with its flavor profile kept entirely under wraps\" and has a Peeps Marshmallow Chick on top, according to a news release from Rita's Italian Ice.In honor of the release of the new flavor, Rita's Italian Ice will host a guessing contest from March 20-29 in which customers can guess the flavor of the Peeps Italian ice on its website to win exclusive prizes.Article continues below this adCT Insider LogoMake CT Insider a preferred source on Google to see more of our journalism when you search.Add Preferred SourceOn Thursday, Dairy Queen gave away free ice cream cones to customers for its free cone day.In April, Ben & Jerry's will also give away free ice cream cones to customers. The ice cream eatery's free cone day will be held from noon to 8 p.m. local time on April 14.CT Insider LogoSatisfy your cravings for food news and plan your weekends.",
